// CREW DOLL — a crew member seated in a craft (docs/crew-and-items.md §3.4):
// the suit model and its animator, no body and no collider. Placed every
// lateUpdate at its seat by scripts/crew_body.lua (crew.dollPose); an open
// seat's rider is posed by command_seat.lua. In a closed pod it is hidden
// unless crew.showInterior (WS2's crew cams and V's IVA).
